<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Rail raises half-year headline shr, no div.</title>
<headline>Rail raises half-year headline shr, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended September 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, headline (cts)   13.2	   vs    10.8</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   9.73	   vs    10.61</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   26.28	  vs    16.96</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.69	   vs    1.12</p>
<p>    Operating costs	 0.93	   vs    0.67</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     nil	    vs    2.67 gain</p>
<p>Full name: Real Africa Investments Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Results for the full year were seen at least matching those in the interim period, the company said. It said they were exploring a number of investment opportunities.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
